#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:1
msgid "llvm-profgen - LLVM SPGO profile generation tool"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:6
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:8
msgid "{program}`llvm-profgen` \\[*commands*\\] \\[*options*\\]"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:10
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:12
msgid ""
"The {program}`llvm-profgen` utility generates a profile data file from given "
"perf script data files for sample-based profile guided optimization(SPGO)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:16
msgid "COMMANDS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:18
msgid "At least one of the following commands are required:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:21
msgid ""
"Path of a trace created by the Linux `perf script` command. For LBR or BRBE "
"input, the raw perf data must contain branch stacks, for example from "
"recording with `-b`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:27
msgid ""
"Path of the ETM trace file created by ARM CoreSight trace tools. Requires "
"the OpenCSD library version 1.5.4 or higher to be enabled during the build."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:32
msgid ""
"Path of raw perf data created by the Linux perf tool. For LBR or BRBE input, "
"it must contain branch stacks, for example from recording with `-b`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:37
msgid ""
"Path of the unsymbolized profile created by `llvm-profgen` with `--skip-"
"symbolization`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:42
msgid "Path of the LLVM sample profile."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:46
msgid ""
"Only one of `--perfscript`, `--perfdata`, `--unsymbolized-profile`, `--llvm-"
"sample-profile`, or `--etm` may be specified at a time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:51
msgid "Path of the input profiled binary files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:55
#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:100
msgid "Path of the output profile file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:58
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:60
msgid "{program}`llvm-profgen` supports the following options:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:63
msgid ""
"Specify the format of the generated profile. Supported \\<format> are "
"`text`, `binary`, `extbinary`, `compbinary`, `gcc`, see `llvm-profdata` for "
"more descriptions of the format."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:69
msgid "Print mmap events."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:73
msgid ""
"Warn when an address covered by a recorded mmap range cannot be symbolized."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:77
msgid "Print disassembled code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:81
msgid ""
"Specify whether to print assembly code in AT&T syntax (the default) or Intel "
"syntax."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:86
msgid ""
"Path of debug info binary. `llvm-profgen` will load the DWARF info from it "
"instead of the executable binary."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:91
msgid ""
"Override the target triple for the binary. This is useful for ETM trace "
"decoding to specify the correct Arm M-profile target."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:96
msgid "Process Id for the profiled executable binary."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-profgen.md:104
msgid ""
"File path of a Linux perf raw trace (generated by `perf report -D`) "
"consisting of memory access events."
msgstr ""
